[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; Editor-owned source for the approved park vertical handoff.
;
; This is not terrain and is not mounted at runtime. It records world-space
; levels and the localized lighthouse regrade as selectable Godot controls.
; Terrain surfaces and curves may be authored against these controls, but no
; generator may overwrite them and no planning-map polygon may be traced.

